      "id": "claim_ba82d667311c4c91973deb8edbdbc872",
      "statement": "Events are partitioned by per-stream scope (tenant, user, agent) for isolation; event paths follow /events/<kind>/<tenant>/<user>/<agent> layout; projections filter within that stream by project/mission/thread/process to enforce read scope.",
